IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `re42-nouns`
IMPORT `re42-s15-advance`

-- Row il-42. TESTS OF SECTION 15, from the text of s 15(b) to (h), worked by hand.
-- Consideration 3,000,000. 15% = 450,000; 7.5% = 225,000. The line after which transfers begin: 40% = 1,200,000 (80% = 2,400,000 where the seller's gain is business income).

§ `Tests of section 15`

GIVEN day IS A DATE
      body IS A BOOLEAN
      moneyOnly IS A BOOLEAN
      reduced IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `A sale as you, the buyer, see it`
`a sale of 3 million` MEANS
    `A sale as you, the buyer, see it` WITH
        `the consideration fixed in the agreement` IS 3_000_000
        `the consideration was fixed in money only` IS moneyOnly
        `the day the seller acquired the right` IS day
        `the seller is a body of persons` IS body
        `the sale is of a qualifying dwelling for which the seller asked for the residential exemption` IS FALSE
        `the seller is the local authority, the Development Authority, the Jewish National Fund or the body named with them` IS FALSE
        `the sale is one to which section 2B(a) of the Sale (Apartments) (Securing Investments of Apartment Buyers) Law applies` IS FALSE
        `the Minister of Finance has excluded a type of sale that covers this one` IS FALSE
        `the seller is taxed on the gain as business income` IS FALSE
        `the rate the Director allowed instead, as a fraction of the consideration, if the Director allowed a smaller one` IS reduced

§§ `The rate by the seller's acquisition day: both sides of 7 November 2001`

#ASSERT `the advance you must transfer to the Director in all` (`a sale of 3 million` (Date 6 11 2001) FALSE TRUE NOTHING) EQUALS 450_000
#ASSERT `the advance you must transfer to the Director in all` (`a sale of 3 million` (Date 7 11 2001) FALSE TRUE NOTHING) EQUALS 225_000
#ASSERT `the advance you must transfer to the Director in all` (`a sale of 3 million` (Date 1 1 1970) FALSE TRUE NOTHING) EQUALS 450_000
#ASSERT `the advance you must transfer to the Director in all` (`a sale of 3 million` (Date 1 1 2010) FALSE TRUE NOTHING) EQUALS 225_000

§§ `A seller that is a body of persons: 7.5% whatever the acquisition day`

#ASSERT `the advance you must transfer to the Director in all` (`a sale of 3 million` (Date 1 1 1970) TRUE TRUE NOTHING) EQUALS 225_000
#ASSERT `the advance you must transfer to the Director in all` (`a sale of 3 million` (Date 1 1 2010) TRUE TRUE NOTHING) EQUALS 225_000

§§ `Money only: otherwise no advance`

#ASSERT `the advance you must transfer to the Director in all` (`a sale of 3 million` (Date 1 1 2010) FALSE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS 0

§§ `The Director's smaller rate`

-- The Director may reduce the rates. A rate above the statutory one is not a reduction: the statutory rate stands.
#ASSERT `the advance you must transfer to the Director in all` (`a sale of 3 million` (Date 1 1 2010) FALSE TRUE (JUST 0.03)) EQUALS 90_000
#ASSERT `the advance you must transfer to the Director in all` (`a sale of 3 million` (Date 1 1 2010) FALSE TRUE (JUST 0.1)) EQUALS 225_000
#ASSERT `the advance you must transfer to the Director in all` (`a sale of 3 million` (Date 1 1 1970) FALSE TRUE (JUST 0.1)) EQUALS 300_000
#ASSERT `the advance you must transfer to the Director in all` (`a sale of 3 million` (Date 1 1 1970) FALSE TRUE (JUST 0.2)) EQUALS 450_000

§§ `The four kinds of sale the duty does not reach (s 15(h))`

`a sale reached by none of the four` MEANS `a sale of 3 million` (Date 1 1 2010) FALSE TRUE NOTHING

GIVEN which IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A sale as you, the buyer, see it`
`a sale reached by exclusion` MEANS
    `A sale as you, the buyer, see it` WITH
        `the consideration fixed in the agreement` IS 3_000_000
        `the consideration was fixed in money only` IS TRUE
        `the day the seller acquired the right` IS Date 1 1 2010
        `the seller is a body of persons` IS FALSE
        `the sale is of a qualifying dwelling for which the seller asked for the residential exemption` IS which EQUALS 1
        `the seller is the local authority, the Development Authority, the Jewish National Fund or the body named with them` IS which EQUALS 2
        `the sale is one to which section 2B(a) of the Sale (Apartments) (Securing Investments of Apartment Buyers) Law applies` IS which EQUALS 3
        `the Minister of Finance has excluded a type of sale that covers this one` IS which EQUALS 4
        `the seller is taxed on the gain as business income` IS FALSE
        `the rate the Director allowed instead, as a fraction of the consideration, if the Director allowed a smaller one` IS NOTHING

#ASSERT `the advance you must transfer to the Director in all` (`a sale reached by none of the four`) EQUALS 225_000
#ASSERT `the advance you must transfer to the Director in all` (`a sale reached by exclusion` 1) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the advance you must transfer to the Director in all` (`a sale reached by exclusion` 2) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the advance you must transfer to the Director in all` (`a sale reached by exclusion` 3) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the advance you must transfer to the Director in all` (`a sale reached by exclusion` 4) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the advance rule does not reach the sale` (`a sale reached by exclusion` 0) EQUALS FALSE

§§ `Out of which payment: the 40% line`

-- Advance 225,000. Line 1,200,000. Paid 0 then 1,200,000: nothing (not MORE than 40%). Paid 0 then 1,200,001: 1. Paid 1,000,000 then 500,000: the 300,000 above the line, capped at the 225,000 advance.
--   Paid 1,200,000 then 100,000: 100,000. Once the advance is fully transferred: 0.
#ASSERT `the share of the consideration after which you transfer` (`a sale reached by none of the four`) EQUALS 0.4
#ASSERT `the amount you transfer out of this payment` (`a sale reached by none of the four`) 0 1_200_000 0 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the amount you transfer out of this payment` (`a sale reached by none of the four`) 0 1_200_001 0 EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the amount you transfer out of this payment` (`a sale reached by none of the four`) 1_000_000 500_000 0 EQUALS 225_000
#ASSERT `the amount you transfer out of this payment` (`a sale reached by none of the four`) 1_200_000 100_000 0 EQUALS 100_000
#ASSERT `the amount you transfer out of this payment` (`a sale reached by none of the four`) 1_500_000 100_000 225_000 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the amount you transfer out of this payment` (`a sale reached by none of the four`) 1_500_000 100_000 200_000 EQUALS 25_000

-- s 15(c1): where the seller's gain is business income the line is 80%: 2,400,000. Paid 2,000,000 then 500,000: 100,000 above the line.
`a business seller's sale` MEANS
    `A sale as you, the buyer, see it` WITH
        `the consideration fixed in the agreement` IS 3_000_000
        `the consideration was fixed in money only` IS TRUE
        `the day the seller acquired the right` IS Date 1 1 2010
        `the seller is a body of persons` IS FALSE
        `the sale is of a qualifying dwelling for which the seller asked for the residential exemption` IS FALSE
        `the seller is the local authority, the Development Authority, the Jewish National Fund or the body named with them` IS FALSE
        `the sale is one to which section 2B(a) of the Sale (Apartments) (Securing Investments of Apartment Buyers) Law applies` IS FALSE
        `the Minister of Finance has excluded a type of sale that covers this one` IS FALSE
        `the seller is taxed on the gain as business income` IS TRUE
        `the rate the Director allowed instead, as a fraction of the consideration, if the Director allowed a smaller one` IS NOTHING

#ASSERT `the share of the consideration after which you transfer` (`a business seller's sale`) EQUALS 0.8
#ASSERT `the amount you transfer out of this payment` (`a business seller's sale`) 2_000_000 500_000 0 EQUALS 100_000
#ASSERT `the amount you transfer out of this payment` (`a business seller's sale`) 1_000_000 500_000 0 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the amount you transfer out of this payment` (`a business seller's sale`) 2_400_000 1_000 0 EQUALS 1_000
